### Who am I
GET {{trelloBaseUrl}}/members/me?key={{trelloKey}}&token={{trelloToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Member's boards
GET {{trelloBaseUrl}}/members/me/boards?fields=name,url&key={{trelloKey}}&token={{trelloToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List board lists
GET {{trelloBaseUrl}}/members/me/boards/{id}/lists?fields=name&key={{trelloKey}}&token={{trelloToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Creates a card
POST {{trelloBaseUrl}}/cards?idList={{listId}}&name={{cardName}}&desc={{cardDescription}}&key={{trelloKey}}&token={{trelloToken}}